# 📊 Supermarket Sales Analysis Dashboard

An interactive **Supermarket Sales Dashboard** built using **Google Looker Studio** to analyze sales performance, profitability, customer behavior, and product performance. This project provides business insights through interactive visualizations and KPI tracking.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The objective of this project is to analyze supermarket sales data and create an interactive dashboard that helps monitor business performance and supports data-driven decision-making.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze overall sales performance.
- Monitor profit and business KPIs.
- Identify top-performing product lines.
- Compare branch and city performance.
- Understand customer purchasing behavior.
- Generate actionable business insights.

---

## 📂 Dataset Information

**Dataset:** Supermarket Sales Dataset

**Dataset Features:**
- Invoice ID
- Branch
- City
- Customer Type
- Gender
- Product Line
- Unit Price
- Quantity
- Tax (5%)
- Total Sales
- Date & Time
- Payment Method
- Cost of Goods Sold (COGS)
- Gross Income
- Gross Margin Percentage
- Customer Rating

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Google Looker Studio
- Microsoft Excel
- Data Cleaning
- Data Visualization

---

## 📊 Dashboard KPIs

- 💰 Total Sales
- 💵 Total Profit
- 🛒 Total Transactions
- 📦 Quantity Sold
- ⭐ Average Rating
- 📈 Profit Margin %

---

## 📈 Dashboard Visualizations

- Sales Trend Over Time
- Sales by Product Line
- Profit by Branch
- Sales by City
- Payment Method Distribution
- Customer Type Distribution
- Sales by Gender
- Average Rating by Product Line
- Top 10 Highest Transactions

---

## 🎛️ Interactive Filters

- Date
- Branch
- City
- Product Line
- Customer Type
- Gender
- Payment Method

---

## 📌 Key Insights

- Generated approximately **323K** in total sales.
- Achieved approximately **15K** in gross profit.
- Maintained an overall **4.76%** profit margin.
- Processed more than **1,000** customer transactions.
- Sold over **6,000** product units.
- Identified top-performing product categories and branches.
- Analyzed customer purchasing behavior using interactive filters.

